What else?

7
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:35,241
"God never intended a
woman to rule this land.

8
00:00:35,243 --> 00:00:36,995
She is the anti-Christ.

9
00:00:37,829 --> 00:00:40,163
- And a Jew."
- A Jew?

10
00:00:40,165 --> 00:00:42,751
