shape of the American flag.

23
00:01:19,913 --> 00:01:22,665
Flesh for the white
stripes, blood for the red.

24
00:01:24,750 --> 00:01:25,877
What else?

25
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:29,837
Lot of threats involving
the C-word, ma'am.

26
00:01:29,839 --> 00:01:31,966
Lots and lots of the
C-word, unfortunately.

27
00:01:34,010 --> 00:01:35,370
You mean Claire?

28
00:01:35,373 --> 00:01:37,637
It's a long list.

29
00:01:37,639 --> 00:01:40,932
- If you really want me to, I'll...
- Listen, I am not the first president

30
00:01:40,934 --> 00:01:42,058
to face threats.

31
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:44,727
I know with Francis, sometimes
there were several a day.

32
00:01:44,729 --> 00:01:46,395
Is it about the same

33
00:01:46,397 --> 00:01:47,857
what we're dealing with here?

34
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,483
It's...

35
00:01:50,485 --> 00:01:51,796
significantly up.

36
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,902
By how much?

37
00:01:52,904 --> 00:01:55,029
There are roughly four
times as many threats

38
00:01:55,031 --> 00:01:57,031
on any given day since you took office.

39
00:01:57,033 --> 00:01:59,577
Now it's twice that since Francis died.

40
00:02:01,538 --> 00:02:03,663
I thought everyone loves a widow.

41
00:02:03,665 --> 00:02:06,039
Not if she's also
Commander-in-Chief, I guess.

42
00:02:06,042 --> 00:02:08,101
These are not rational
people, Madam President.

43
00:02:08,104 --> 00:02:10,771
But, ma'am, as far as today's threat,

44
00:02:10,774 --> 00:02:12,630
regarding your first
scheduled appearance...

45
00:02:12,632 --> 00:02:14,092
We're canceling the appearance.

46
00:02:16,427 --> 00:02:17,804
We're not canceling.

47
00:02:18,847 --> 00:02:19,971
It's a military base.

48
00:02:19,973 --> 00:02:22,598
That's got to be the safest
place on Earth for a president.

49
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:25,359
An anonymous soldier has
made a serious threat...

50
00:02:25,362 --> 00:02:28,312
"To shoot me in the cunt on behalf
of the United States of America."

51
00:02:28,314 --> 00:02:30,481
Yes, Mark, I heard. The
threat's unconfirmed.

52
00:02:30,483 --> 00:02:32,233
He says he's among
those shipping out today.

53
00:02:32,235 --> 00:02:34,318
- Anyone can claim that.
- And that you have no right

54
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:36,779
waging war in Syria. You, in particular.

55
00:02:36,781 --> 00:02:38,585
I think we stay away.
Rick, don't you agree?

56
00:02:38,588 --> 00:02:41,515
There's no proof the threat is
credible. Isn't that right, Rick?

57
00:02:41,518 --> 00:02:43,786
Our intelligence
division is investigating,

58
00:02:43,788 --> 00:02:46,706
and the advance team is already
there, but it'll take at least a day

59
00:02:46,708 --> 00:02:48,203
to comb through that base.

60
00:02:48,206 --> 00:02:51,544
I think what the vice president
says is the best course.

61
00:02:51,546 --> 00:02:55,091
- Maybe by tomorrow you could...
- Tomorrow is the fifth of July.

62
00:02:56,926 --> 00:02:59,594
- Yes, ma'am.
- So what do you suggest I do?

63
00:02:59,596 --> 00:03:01,582
Wish the nation a
happy belated birthday?

64
00:03:01,585 --> 00:03:03,139
Our only concern is your safety...

65
00:03:03,141 --> 00:03:04,434
We're not cancelling.

66
00:03:05,143 --> 00:03:07,687
I am sending those
soldiers onto a battlefield.

67
00:03:08,461 --> 00:03:10,670
The first female president
of the United States

68
00:03:10,673 --> 00:03:14,107
is not gonna keep her mouth shut
on the Fourth of fucking July.

