There's only one kind.

108
00:09:15,471 --> 00:09:17,306
Pain is pain.

109
00:09:27,149 --> 00:09:28,274
Francis...

110
00:09:29,986 --> 00:09:31,195
I'm done with you.

111
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:44,581
There.

112
00:09:44,584 --> 00:09:45,882
No more pain.

113
