You know all about it.

157
00:12:31,375 --> 00:12:34,503
Well, for a long time, I
pretended he was still alive.

158
00:12:35,337 --> 00:12:36,837
Out of town.

159
00:12:36,839 --> 00:12:39,590
It was our son Duncan
that really saved me.

160
00:12:39,592 --> 00:12:42,553
Of course, we weren't married
anywhere near as long as you and Frank.

161
00:12:43,220 --> 00:12:44,386
Claire Hale.

162
00:12:45,598 --> 00:12:47,394
Nine years.

163
00:12:47,397 --> 00:12:49,059
Late spring,

164
00:12:49,935 --> 00:12:51,560
Sun Valley.

165
00:12:54,315 --> 00:12:55,898
You look exactly the same.

166
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:58,442
Well, it's cities that age you,

167
00:12:58,444 --> 00:13:00,029
it's what I tell everyone.

168
00:13:02,143 --> 00:13:06,118
I hope you don't mind saying hello
to a few of our closest friends.

169
00:13:07,369 --> 00:13:10,329
They're just here for
a cocktail before the...

170
00:13:10,331 --> 00:13:13,791
The sun goes down and the
rest of the party shows up.

171
00:13:13,793 --> 00:13:16,962
My sister's fireworks show have
become a bit of a tradition.

172
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:23,511
Don't worry. They know
how to be discreet.

173
