Scotty here just got his
hands on Nexis Security.

174
00:13:31,852 --> 00:13:34,311
I heard you are speaking to
the vice president about this.

175
00:13:34,313 --> 00:13:36,104
It's a company of peacekeepers, mostly.

176
00:13:36,106 --> 00:13:39,258
Oh, tremendous potential to
create global partnerships.

177
00:13:39,261 --> 00:13:42,530
Your husband helped me secure the deal.
I wanted to bring him onto the Board.

178
00:13:43,447 --> 00:13:44,530
Bill was saying...

179
00:13:44,532 --> 00:13:45,984
Yes, I was just saying.

180
00:13:45,987 --> 00:13:50,993
Why in the world do they play the
"1812 Overture" at a fireworks show?

181
00:13:50,996 --> 00:13:53,541
It's Russian, for
Chrissakes, in every sense.

182
00:13:54,625 --> 00:13:56,542
This is Tabitha.

183
00:13:56,544 --> 00:13:58,308
Oh. Peters, I know.

184
00:13:59,338 --> 00:14:00,816
Frank...

185
00:14:00,819 --> 00:14:03,632
- Wasn't he planning to be here today?
- He was.

186
00:14:03,634 --> 00:14:05,344
You must miss him terribly.

187
00:14:06,428 --> 00:14:09,221
I had some long and hard-fought
conversations with him.

188
00:14:09,223 --> 00:14:12,808
He was going to help me
resolve this AFL-CIO thing

189
00:14:12,810 --> 00:14:14,852
that's been going on
forever out in Nevada,

190
00:14:14,854 --> 00:14:16,687
with your help, of course.

191
00:14:16,689 --> 00:14:19,356
When the union stands
in the way of innovation,

192
00:14:19,358 --> 00:14:21,277
it's sentencing itself to death.

193
00:14:22,611 --> 00:14:25,404
I do admire the way you
hang on to your party.

194
00:14:25,406 --> 00:14:26,699
Your loyalty.

195
00:14:28,033 --> 00:14:30,409
Did I hear that Lieutenant
General Nancy Gallagher

196
00:14:30,411 --> 00:14:32,246
will be appearing with you later today?

197
00:14:36,333 --> 00:14:38,542
I think she'd make an
excellent candidate,

198
00:14:38,544 --> 00:14:41,003
if she decides to run, of course.

199
